* @title Gimpel hexadecimal string conversion
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapters 2.6 (HEX) and 2.7 (CH); Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* 414243
* 534E4F424F4C
* ABC
* SNOBOL
* <<<
-INCLUDE "CH.INC"
-INCLUDE "HEX.INC"
	OUTPUT = HEX('ABC')
	OUTPUT = HEX('SNOBOL')
	OUTPUT = CH(HEX('ABC'))
	OUTPUT = CH(HEX('SNOBOL'))
END
